1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:06,660
A benefit concert for the Blue Hills Animal Shelter will be held Friday July 17th at the Orion Theater.

2
00:00:07,660 --> 00:00:11,240
Many of your favorite artists, performers, and musicians will be there.

3
00:00:11,880 --> 00:00:21,500
We are also proud to announce that the event will be recorded as part of CBS Television's special concert series and will be released on CD and DVD.

4
00:00:22,560 --> 00:00:28,000
All proceeds will be donated to the animal shelter so that it can continue its great work.

5
00:00:29,020 --> 00:00:29,800
So don't be late!

6
00:00:30,200 --> 00:00:34,105
Buy your tickets today, and you can be part of this historic event.
